Just like an angel.
看看你。
就像天使一样。

01:21.418 --> 01:23.832
All right, that's it.
好吧，就是这样。

01:23.832 --> 01:26.625
Get out.
出去。

01:26.625 --> 01:30.867
Okay, see you around, friend.
好的，再见，朋友。

