不在这里。

02:18.384 --> 02:20.453
Hey, Squidward!
嘿，章鱼哥！

02:20.453 --> 02:23.522
Remember that time
I dedicated a song to you?
还记得那个时候
我献给你一首歌？

02:29.211 --> 02:31.177
Oh, you do remember.
哦，你还记得。

02:34.246 --> 02:37.556
Leave me be.
别管我了。

02:41.729 --> 02:44.280
Remember the time
I got you these rocket skates?
记住时间
我给你买了这双火箭溜冰鞋？

02:44.280 --> 02:46.315
Uh, no.
呃，不。

02:46.315 --> 02:49.591
That's because we're making
a new memory.
那是因为我们正在做
一个新的记忆。

02:52.073 --> 02:54.453
- No.
- Happy friend-iversary.
- 不。
- 朋友纪念日快乐。

03:11.729 --> 03:13.591
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

03:20.004 --> 03:26.832
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

03:48.004 --> 03:51.970
Oh, the Kelpie G concert.
哦，Kelpie G 演唱会。

03:51.970 --> 03:55.280
