现在看来，那是一段美好的回忆。

03:57.211 --> 03:59.522
Huh.
呵呵。

03:59.522 --> 04:03.073
Huh?
"Remember this, Squidward?"
啊？
“还记得这个吗，章鱼哥？”

04:09.660 --> 04:12.108
Happy friend-iversary.
朋友纪念日快乐。

04:17.694 --> 04:20.935
Huh?
- Remember this, Squidward?
啊？
- 还记得这个吗，章鱼哥？

04:20.935 --> 04:22.694
Huh?
啊？

04:22.694 --> 04:25.522
Remember this, Squidward?
还记得这个吗，章鱼哥？

04:25.522 --> 04:29.108
Remember this, Squidward?
还记得这个吗，章鱼哥？

04:29.108 --> 04:31.453
Please, you got to help me.
拜托，你一定要帮助我。

04:31.453 --> 04:33.867
Remember this, Squidward?
还记得这个吗，章鱼哥？

04:33.867 --> 04:36.418
Oh, no. Not you. No, no.
哦，不。不是你。不，不。

04:36.418 --> 04:37.694
Friend-iversary.
Friend-iversary.
朋友纪念日。
朋友纪念日。

04:37.694 --> 04:39.625
<i>Happy friend-iversary.</i>
<i>朋友周年快乐。</i>

04:42.556 --> 04:44.487
He remembers everything.
他记得一切。

04:44.487 --> 04:46.108
Everything that happened.
所发生的一切。

04:46.108 --> 04:47.522
Even things that didn't happen.
即使没有发生的事情。

04:47.522 --> 04:49.556
Maybe even things
that will happen.
甚至可能是一些事情
那将会发生。

04:49.556 --> 04:52.246
Things that will never happen.
永远不会发生的事情。

04:52.246 --> 04:56.418
If he remembers it, it happens.
如果他记得的话，就会发生。

04:56.418 --> 04:59.211
Get ahold of yourself, Squidward.
控制住自己，章鱼哥。

05:02.763 --> 05:04.763
There's got to be a way out.
必须有一条出路。

05:04.763 --> 05:07.487
There's got to be
a way to erase...
一定有
一种擦除...的方法

05:10.418 --> 05:12.418
An eraser.
一块橡皮。

05:12.418 --> 05:16.901
I'll erase his memories of me.
我会抹去他对我的记忆。

05:43.349 --> 05:47.625
There's only one more place
he keeps his memories.
只剩下一个地方了
他保留着他的记忆。

05:53.625 --> 05:57.487
Erase me. Erase me.
抹掉我吧抹掉我吧

05:57.487 --> 06:00.177
Oh, Squidward,
let's be roommates
哦，章鱼哥，
我们做室友吧

06:00.177 --> 06:03.970
and live together forever
and ever and ever.
并永远生活在一起
永远永远。

06:13.246 --> 06:18.901
SpongeBob?
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？
海绵宝宝？

06:18.901 --> 06:20.073
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

06:30.694 --> 06:33.073
Good morning.
- Oh, good morning.
早上好。
- 哦，早上好。

06:33.073 --> 06:37.522
You must be the new cashier.
Nice to meet you.
你一定是新来的收银员。
很高兴见到你。

06:37.522 --> 06:40.556
