07:19.970 --> 07:22.625
And because he never wanted
to forget it,
因为他从来不想
忘记它，

07:22.625 --> 07:28.315
ha attached it to a memory he
had with you, Mr. Squidward.
哈哈把它附加到他的记忆中
和你在一起了，章鱼哥先生。

07:28.315 --> 07:33.625
